### Create a new Branch
POST http://localhost:3000/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_name": "MeMeem Branch",
  "branch_address": "123 Main Street",
  "branch_phone_number": "123456789",
  "owner_id": 6
}

### Get all Branches
GET http://localhost:3000/branches

### Get a specific Branch by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/branches/5

### Update a Branch by ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/branches/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_name": "Updated Branch Name",
  "branch_address": "456 Secondary Street"
}

### Delete a Branch by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/branches/4

### Get Owner's Branches (อื่นๆที่ไม่ใช่ตัวเอง)
GET http://localhost:3000/branches/owner/my-branches
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 1

